specs\new-arch\2026-05-16-overlay-message-turn-agent-cards.md:212:Integrity review is already a real session and should follow the same mechanism when it emits normal message rows. If integrity produces one message, it will produce one segment card. `materializeIntegrity(session, payload)` must target `session.activeCardID`, not `session.cardID`.
specs\new-arch\2026-05-16-overlay-message-turn-agent-cards.md:214:If an integrity completed event arrives before message metadata, keep the existing pending map keyed by `sessionID`; drain it after the first turn card materializes.
